__pycache__/
*.pyc
.state/
# Generated QA logs live in ~/qa-log/<project>/ and stay there.  They are
# verbatim transcripts of working sessions and have been observed to contain
# host addresses and a sudo password, so the OUTPUT is never published -- only
# the tooling that produces it.
qa-log/*/
qa-log/*.md
!qa-log/README.md
# Anything holding a webhook or a key.  wifi_report reads its webhook from
# /etc/wifi_report.conf on the device; that file is a bearer credential and
# belongs nowhere near this repo.
*.conf
*secret*
*credential*
